     "<div dir=\"ltr\">HI,<div><br></div><div><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px\">I am trying to build a shiny app which requires package &quot;openNLPmodels.en&quot;.<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px\">The Package &quot;openNLPmodels.en&quot; is currently removed from the CRAN but i have installed it through source &quot;<a href=\"http://datacube.wu.ac.at/\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(3,102,214)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://datacube.wu.ac.at/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360762132000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0eEyuLFY53Ethua_ZJMWb2\">http://datacube.wu.ac.at</a>&quot;.<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px\">As <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360762132000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0SD8C8GDhU1g4AjzDb5fUF\">shinyapps.io</a> service supports only packages installed from CRAN, GitHub (both public and private repos), and BioConductor. Because of this reason i am unable to publish the app, where as i am able to run the app locally.</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px\">I want to know why won&#39;t/when will it  <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360762132000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0SD8C8GDhU1g4AjzDb5fUF\">shinyapps.io</a> service support packages installed from sources other than CRAN, GitHub (both public and private repos), and BioConductor.</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px\">Thanks<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">Naveen Goud Bobburi</p></div></div>"
